  "description": "The Roure Pinion Smart.Shift evolves our ATB concept with advanced shifting technology. Handcrafted in titanium, with generous tyre clearance, a large main triangle, and numerous mounting points, it is built for demanding expeditions and extended bikepacking journeys. It is engineered for serious off-road travel and fully loaded adventures. The Pinion Smart.Shift electronic gearbox delivers fast, precise shifting at the push of a button - even under load. Integrated into the frame and paired with a Gates Carbon Belt Drive, it forms a clean, protected, and low-maintenance drivetrain built for long-distance exploration. The Roure Pinion Smart.Shift blends electronic precision with mechanical robustness, creating an expedition bike ready for the most ambitious routes.",
